From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 23:40:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Implement emoji reactions for statuses

- Create status_reactions table and update status_stats
- Add API endpoints for adding and removing reactions
- Integrate ActivityPub support for emoji reactions
- Introduce frontend UI components for reactions
- Update notification system for reaction events
- Implement ReactService and UnreactService logic

Rationale: Enabling emoji reactions improves social interaction by providing a more expressive way for users to engage with content across the platform.

Co-authored-by: fef <owo@fef.moe>
Co-authored-by: Jeremy Kescher <jeremy@kescher.at>
Co-authored-by: neatchee <neatchee@gmail.com>
Co-authored-by: Ivan Rodriguez <104603218+IRod22@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-authored-by: Plastikmensch <plastikmensch@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-authored-by: Essem <smswessem@gmail.com>
